    <dcterms:source>UN/EDIFACT code list 1153.
For EU CDM usage:
Additional references must be entered in the form of a code defined in Title I.
The list of additional references and their respective codes can be found in the TARIC database, their format is a1an3.
Member States may define national codes, national codes must have the format n1an3</dcterms:source>
